@startuml state-delivery
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #fafafa
  BorderColor #555555
  ArrowColor #333333
  FontSize 11
}
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #fffde7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #d0d0d0
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title Delivery — State Machine

[*] --> PENDING : created when Order → READY

PENDING --> ASSIGNED : DeliveryAssigned event\n(offer accepted, COU-02)
PENDING --> CANCELLED : order cancelled\nduring DISPATCHING

ASSIGNED --> PICKED_UP : courier marks pickup (COU-04)
ASSIGNED --> CANCELLED : customer cancels\n[before pickup] (CUS-06)

PICKED_UP --> DELIVERED : courier marks delivery (COU-04)

DELIVERED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

PENDING : if no candidate accepts: alert to operator (SYS-04)
PENDING : delivery stays PENDING in V1

note right of ASSIGNED
  Each assignment appends an AssignmentRecord
  (audit trail — see class diagram).
  Reassignment by operator is V2:
  ASSIGNED → PENDING with a new courierId.
end note
@enduml
